00:43:16,363 --> 00:43:22,363
Captain America: Brave New World is a 2025 American superhero film based on
Marvel Comics featuring the character Sam Wilson / Captain America.

13
00:46:52,727 --> 00:46:58,727
Produced by Marvel Studios and distributed by Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures, it is the fourth installment in the Captain America film series, a
continuation of the television miniseries The Falcon and the Winter Soldier (2021), and the 35th film in the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU).

14
00:50:29,090 --> 00:50:35,090
The film was directed by Julius Onah from a screenplay by Rob Edwards and the
writing teams of Malcolm Spellman & Dalan Musson and Onah & Peter Glanz.

15
00:54:05,454 --> 00:54:11,454
It stars Anthony Mackie as Sam Wilson / Captain America alongside Danny Ramirez, Shira Haas, Carl
Lumbly, Xosha Roquemore, Giancarlo Esposito, Liv Tyler, Tim Blake Nelson, and Harrison Ford.

16
00:57:41,818 --> 00:57:47,818
In the film, Wilson investigates a conspiracy involving U.S.

17
01:01:18,181 --> 01:01:24,181
president Thaddeus Ross (Ford).

18
01:04:54,545 --> 01:05:00,545
Captain America: Civil War (2016) ended the Captain America trilogy starring Chris Evans as Steve
Rogers, and Wilson becomes the new Captain America in The Falcon and the Winter Soldier.

19
01:08:30,909 --> 01:08:36,909
Series writers Spellman and Musson were writing a new Captain America
film by April 2021, and Mackie signed on that August.

20
01:12:07,272 --> 01:12:13,272
Onah joined in July 2022, when the title Captain
America: New World Order was announced.

21
01:15:43,636 --> 01:15:49,636
Additional cast members joined later that year.

22
01:19:20,000 --> 01:19:26,000
Nelson and Tyler returned from the second MCU film, The Incredible Hulk (2008), while Ford replaced William Hurt
as Ross following Hurt's death in March 2022; Ross becomes the superpowered Red Hulk in the film.

23
01:22:56,363 --> 01:23:02,363
Filming took place from March to June 2023 at Trilith Studios in
Atlanta, Georgia, with additional filming in Washington, D.C.

24
01:26:32,727 --> 01:26:38,727
The subtitle was changed to Brave New World during filming.

25
01:30:09,090 --> 01:30:15,090
Matthew Orton joined in December 2023 to write for reshoots, which took place
between May and November 2024, and added Esposito to the film.

26
01:33:45,454 --> 01:33:51,454
The involvement of Edwards and Glanz was revealed that December.

27
01:37:21,818 --> 01:37:27,818
Captain America: Brave New World premiered on February 11, 2025, at the TCL Chinese Theatre in Hollywood, Los
Angeles, and was released in the United States on February 14 as part of Phase Five of the MCU.

28
01:40:58,181 --> 01:41:04,181
It grossed $415 million worldwide.

29
01:44:34,545 --> 01:44:40,545
The film received mixed reviews from critics for its story,
connections to other MCU projects, and visual effects.

30
01:48:10,909 --> 01:48:16,909
The performances, particularly those of Mackie and Ford, received praise.

31
01:51:47,272 --> 01:51:53,272
The film explores themes of hero, usa president, the
white house, superhero, based on comic.

32
01:55:23,636 --> 01:55:29,636
The tone is thought_provoking and intense.
